  "body": "Anedge-case is if you set left/top/right to auto, you'll currently get the hypothetical static inline position, not block:\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<style>\r\n    dialog { top: auto; left: auto; right: auto }\r\n</style>\r\nIs the dialog below or to the right of this text?\r\n<dialog>DIALOG CONTENTS</dialog>\r\n<script>\r\n    document.querySelector(\"dialog\").show();\r\n</script>\r\n\r\nHow are you handling it?",
